> > > 
> > > Hi Marc,
> > > 
> > > > diff --git a/drivers/base/arch_numa.c b/drivers/base/arch_numa.c
> > > > index e187016764265..5457248eb0811 100644
> > > > --- a/drivers/base/arch_numa.c
